$7C85 c ScrollItemsLeft ; Select the next slot: scroll the strip 24 pixels left, one pixel a frame
> Returns if ItemSelected is ItemLast. Else ItemSelected + 1, and 24 times: shifts the strip's 18 lines in the play buffer ($5B66-$5B77, 17 bytes a line) one pixel left, cycles the frame (CycleWindowFrame) and shows the strip (ShowItemStrip). Also run three times at the stage's start ($97FF, with the frame cycle patched off) to roll the strip in.
