$8090 b ArcFrame 4 ; The thrown object's frame record: a word (0, the graphics come in HL), 2 bytes wide, 6 lines
$8094 c CheckArcLanding ; At arc steps 12 and 21: if the cell under the object is not free, hold the step
> Tests the cell at (x + 3, y + 8) with $B162; not free (Z) decrements +3 so the object rests.
> Witness: L1 160 (rzx-r1).
$809E CheckArcLandingCell
$80B2 c CheckPitDrop ; An object below y $82: outside room 12 freed; in room 12 counted (EyeFlashRepeats, PitDrops up to 9; the tenth object, PitDrops already 9, sets BossPhase 2)
> Only while BossPhase is 1. Above y $82: returns at once. CP $09 / JR Z,CheckPitDropDone comes before the INC, so
