$8B4E c StepFineBack ; Move the actor IY back by A eighths of a byte column
> Takes A from the fraction +$11; on a borrow adds 8 back and moves the base column +$0D one column against the
> facing (StepX $B112 with E = -1). Called by $8736 and the warrior's flying head $9474.
