$9D47 ItemTemplate ; an item lying on the floor (SpawnItem $A098): 2 x 16, handler $A0E9
$9D59 PieceTemplate ; a piece of the stage's artefact (handler $8233)
$9D6B FragmentTemplate ; a fragment of a broken urn (3 x 11, handler $A891)
$9D7D WarriorTemplate ; the warrior that rises from the ground (SpawnRandomEnemy $9353): handler WarriorActor
